  "job_B8.1.7.2_20251003_114824": {
    "chunk_text": "De Libro Iudicum, Anglice. \u00c6fter \u00f0am \u00f0e Moyses, se m\u00e6ra heretoga, \u00fe\u00e6t Godes folc gel\u00e6dde of Pharaones \u00feeowette ofer \u00f0a & God hi eac sona h\u00e6\u00f0enum leodum let to anwealde, swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan h\u00e6fdon heora geweald, swa \u00d0a funde he him sona sumne fultum \u00e6fre, & he hig ahredde of \u00feam re\u00f0an \u00feeowte \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00f0enra leoda Hig n\u00e6fdon manne cyning him gecorenne \u00fea git, for \u00f0am \u00fee God sylf w\u00e6s heora wissiend \u00fea & WE willa\u00f0 nu secgan swutelicor be \u00feisum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t Israhela folc \u00e6fter Iosuam for\u00f0si\u00fee, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00feelan God wear\u00f0 him \u00fea yrre for yfelum d\u00e6dum, & bet\u00e6hte hig Chusam, \u00feam h\u00e6\u00feenan cyninge, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hig Hig \u00fea eft clipodon to \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan Gode, & he him asende sona his fultum; gesette him anne On him w\u00e6s Godes gast, & he hig \u00fea gewissode & feaht wi\u00f0 \u00feone Chusan & hine ofercom sona \u00f0urh & hi sy\u00f0\u00f0an wunedon on fulre sybbe ealles feowertig geara, & Othoniel \u00fea geendode his dagas. Eft \u00fea Israhel \u00e6fter his for\u00f0si\u00fee geeacnodon heora yfel & \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan God mid weorcum Se hig ofsloh swi\u00f0e & heora burh gewann & gewilde hig ealle, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hig him \u00feeowodon on Hig clipodon \u00fea swi\u00f0e on heora geswencednisse to \u00feam heofonlican Gode, his helpes biddende,",
